        <text id="5192">
            <property name="marginTop">20pt</property>
            <property name="contentType">html</property>
            <text-property name="content"><![CDATA[<b><u> Disclaimer </u></b><br/><br/>
We would like to confirm that SVG-Germany has successfully received your payment. Please note that this receipt is <b>not valid for German tax benefits</b>. If you require any further documentation or assistance, feel free to contact us.  
<br/><br/>
Thank you for your payment and cooperation.
<br/><br/>
With warm regards,<br/>
Shree Swaminarayan Vadtal Gadi - Germany<br/>
<b>https://germany.svg.org/<b>]]></text-property>
        </text>
